# Shift+Tab and Ctrl+J type nothing and break nothing in Quick Add, and Tab opens the project picker, which Esc closes; the text stays one line.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
END
keys q a <Tab>
see ┌Project
keys <Esc> b <S-Tab> c <C-j> d
hide ┌Project
see - abcd
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- abcd
END
